    <p data-block-key="snvv7">Gemini 3.5 Transcribe’s performance represents a major advancement from our previous transcription model, Chirp 3, offering new capabilities, improved word error rates, and significantly better latency. As measured by Artificial Analysis, time to final transcription, for example, improves by 70%. On the FLEURS benchmark across a set of top languages and locales, the model delivers precise multilingual performance, improving over Chirp 3, and achieving a 5.50% WER in streaming mode and 5.04% WER in non-streaming use-cases.</p>
