    <div><h2 data-block-key="csyrr">Read the early reviews</h2><p data-block-key="dl6ri">By leveraging the Gemini Live API, developer platforms such as <a href="https://docs.agora.io/en/ai/models/asr/gemini">Agora</a>, <a href="https://docs.fishjam.io/tutorials/gemini-live-integration">Fishjam</a>, <a href="https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/trace-gemini-live">LangChain</a>, <a href="https://docs.livekit.io/agents/models/stt/gemini/">LiveKit</a>, <a href="https://docs.pipecat.ai/api-reference/server/services/stt/google">Pipecat</a>, <a href="https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/modalities/speech-to-text">Vercel</a>, and <a href="https://visionagents.ai/integrations/stt/gemini">Vision Agents</a> enable developers to build and deploy high-performance voice-driven interfaces with ease. These platforms manage complex real-time media streaming infrastructure behind the scenes, allowing developers to focus entirely on crafting the user experience.</p><p data-block-key="a93kl">Companies like vivo, Intellitek Health, and Lingopal have also shared positive feedback on 3.5 Transcribe, highlighting its impressive latency, accuracy, and expansive language support.</p></div>
