  <uni-article-paragraph>
    <p data-block-key="m46dy">Here’s how you can extend your scene with the Gemini API:</p>
  </uni-article-paragraph>
</section>

  

  
    

<div aria-label="Code to extend a video" data-component="uni-code-block" data-analytics-module="{
    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Code Block&quot;,
    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash lets you build with more control&quot;
