  <uni-article-paragraph>
    <div><h2 data-block-key="roa64">Specify first and last frames</h2><p data-block-key="dkmbh">Achieve smooth transitions and camera movements by specifying the starting and ending frames of a shot. Omni 1.1 generates continuous video between two keyframes, making it ideal for complex camera orbits, zoom transitions, or seamless looping clips.</p></div>
  </uni-article-paragraph>
</section>

  

  
    





























