            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://Habitat-Thinking.github.io/ai-literacy-superpowers/plugins/ai-literacy-superpowers/explanation/harness-engineering/">https://Habitat-Thinking.github.io/ai-literacy-superpowers/plugins/ai-literacy-superpowers/explanation/harness-engineering/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49464970">Hacker News</a></p>
